      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree on the HTTP related permissions, the other stuff seems like a bit much though\n\nEdit: Meh not sure I'm a fan of needing to specify the domains that will be used in a world. Plenty of use-cases for loading (or redirecting to) some domain that isn't known ahead of time",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
