      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Access to a users skeleton and play space tracking data? Display name? Unique Identifier?\n\nThat's a bit much.\n\nSpecify each individual domain? And I assume the user needs to accept these permissions every time they load into the world. It's all a bit much.\n\nA generic \"This world would like to post data to outside services\" would suffice. If you're really paranoid, a 'View Requested Domains' button could be made available to see exactly which ones will be contacted.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
